  "bodyHash": "7LbpewL5cgw=",
  "content": "你好<br>\n\n<center>\n\t<img title=\"Friends&amp;Foes\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/logo.png\" alt=\"Friends&amp;Foes\" width=\"836\">\n</center>\n\n<br>\n\n<center>\n\t<a style=\"text-decoration: none;\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/faboslav\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Buy Me a Coffee&color=5b9c51&labelColor=5b9c51&logoColor=ffffff&style=for-the-badge&logo=ko-fi\" alt=\"Buy Me a Coffee\">\n\t</a>\n\t<a style=\"text-decoration: none;\" href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Faboslav\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Become a Patron&color=5b9c51&labelColor=5b9c51&logoColor=ffffff&style=for-the-badge&logo=patreon\" alt=\"Patreon\">\n\t</a>\n\t<a style=\"text-decoration: none;\" href=\"https://discord.gg/QGwFvvMQCn\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/924964658169913404?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=ffffff&label=Join Our Discord&labelColor=5b9c51&color=5b9c51\" alt=\"Join Our Discord\">\n\t</a>\n\t<a style=\"text-decoration: none;\" href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Wiki&logoColor=ffffff&style=for-the-badge&logo=github&labelColor=5b9c51&color=5b9c51\" alt=\"Wiki\">\n\t</a>\n</center>\n\n<br>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\tFriends&amp;Foes 添加了历届生物投票中落选的被遗忘生物。主要目标之一是扩展原始概念，并为所有生物添加符合原版风格的新特性。\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t你可以在<a title=\"wiki\" href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki\">Wiki</a>查看已实现生物和特性的详细介绍。\n</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<h1>\n\t<img title=\"Crab\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/crab.gif\" alt=\"Crab\" width=\"60\">\n\t<span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>\n\t<span>螃蟹</span>\n</h1>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t介绍<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Crab\">螃蟹</a>，这种友好的生物在红树林沼泽和海滩漫步。\n\t想延长你的触及范围？蟹钳可以用来酿造增加触及范围的药水，为你的冒险提供宝贵优势。\n\t如果你想<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Crab#breeding\">繁殖</a>这个小家伙，你需要海带和耐心，因为螃蟹需要将卵\"埋\"在安全的地方。\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/crab_1.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/crab_1.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"挥钳的螃蟹\" title=\"挥钳的螃蟹\">\n\t</a>\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/crab_2.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/crab_2.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"攀爬红树的螃蟹\" title=\"攀爬红树的螃蟹\">\n\t</a>\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t与螃蟹相关的其他特性：\n</p>\n<ul style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Craw-Claw\">蟹钳</a>物品</li>\n\t<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Reaching\">延展</a>状态效果</li>\n</ul>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<h1>\n\t<img title=\"Tuff Golem\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/tuff_golem.gif\" alt=\"Tuff Golem\" width=\"40\">\n\t<span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>\n\t<span>凝灰岩傀儡</span>\n</h1>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Tuff-Golem\">凝灰岩傀儡</a>，一种雕像般的生物，可以持有并展示你给它的任何物品，但当它不睡觉时喜欢随意漫步，要小心。\n\t想让凝灰岩傀儡待在原地？用<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Tuff-Golem#glueing\">蜜脾</a>把它粘住。如果你想<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Tuff-Golem#creation\">建造</a>这个沉睡的美人，需要收集凝灰岩块、任意<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Tuff-Golem#dyeing\">颜色</a>的羊毛块和南瓜。\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/tuff_golem_1.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/tuff_golem_1.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"手持附魔书的凝灰岩傀儡\" title=\"手持附魔书的凝灰岩傀儡\">\n\t</a>\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/tuff_golem_2.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/tuff_golem_2.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"沉睡的凝灰岩傀儡\" title=\"沉睡的凝灰岩傀儡\">\n\t</a>\n</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<h1>\n\t<img title=\"Rascal\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/rascal.gif\" alt=\"Rascal\" width=\"40\">\n\t<span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>\n\t<span>捣蛋鬼</span>\n</h1>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t发现<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Rascal\">捣蛋鬼</a>，这种顽皮的小生物出没在矿井中，以捉迷藏为乐。\n\t它既顽皮又乐于助人，在你寻找它时会给出提示。\n\t找到它三次，它会奖励你梦寐以求的收纳袋！\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/rascal_1.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/rascal_1.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"矿井中的捣蛋鬼\" title=\"矿井中的捣蛋鬼\">\n\t</a>\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/rascal_2.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/rascal_2.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"抛出收纳袋的捣蛋鬼\" title=\"抛出收纳袋的捣蛋鬼\">\n\t</a>\n</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<h1>\n\t<img title=\"Copper Golem\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/copper_golem.gif\" alt=\"Copper Golem\" width=\"40\">\n\t<span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>\n\t<span>铜傀儡</span>\n</h1>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t认识<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Copper-Golem\">铜傀儡</a>，这种袖珍的喜剧演员喜欢随机按下铜按钮。\n\t和其他铜制品一样，它会随着时间<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Copper-Golem#oxidation\">氧化</a>，但别担心，维护很简单！想要快速翻新，用<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Copper-Golem#scraping\">斧头</a>或<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Copper-Golem#waxing\">蜜脾</a>即可。\n\t如果你想<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Copper-Golem#creation\">建造</a>这个小家伙，需要收集铜块、南瓜和避雷针。\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/copper_golem_1.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/copper_golem_1.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"村庄中的铜傀儡工作站结构\" title=\"村庄中的铜傀儡工作站结构\">\n\t</a>\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/copper_golem_2.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/copper_golem_2.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"铜傀儡们\" title=\"铜傀儡们\">\n\t</a>\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t与铜傀儡相关的其他特性：\n</p>\n<ul style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Copper-Golem-Workstation\">铜傀儡工作站</a>村庄结构</li>\n\t<li>所有氧化阶段的<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Copper-Button\">铜按钮</a></li>\n\t<li>所有氧化阶段的<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Lightning-Rod\">避雷针</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<h1>\n\t<img style=\"height: 40px; margin-bottom: 0px;\" title=\"Glare\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/glare.webp\" alt=\"Glare\" width=\"40\">\n\t<span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>\n\t<span>怒目怪</span>\n</h1>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t介绍<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Glare\">怒目怪</a>，这种脾气暴躁又可爱的苔藓伙伴生活在繁茂洞穴中，讨厌黑暗。\n\t你也厌恶黑暗吗？怒目怪可以向你展示黑暗到足以生成怪物的区域。\n\t如果你想<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Glare#taming\">驯服</a>或<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Glare#breeding\">繁殖</a>这个小可爱，需要发光浆果，但要小心，怒目怪会经常吃掉它们，不留任何剩余。\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/glare_1.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/glare_1.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"幼年和成年怒目怪\" title=\"幼年和成年怒目怪\">\n\t</a>\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/glare_2.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/glare_2.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"繁茂洞穴中飞行的怒目怪\" title=\"繁茂洞穴中飞行的怒目怪\">\n\t</a>\n</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<h1>\n\t<img title=\"Iceologer\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/iceologer.webp\" alt=\"Iceologer\" width=\"25\">\n\t<span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>\n\t<span>冰术师</span>\n</h1>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t遭遇<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Iceologer\">冰术师</a>，这个孤独的灾厄村民生活在雪原深处。\n\t你可以在树林间寻找小型云杉<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Iceologer-Cabin\">小屋</a>来找到他。\n\t但冒险时要小心，多年的野外生活使他的心比周围的冰更冷。如果他发现你，准备好应对<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Iceologer-Cabin\">冰霜攻击</a>，这将使你的冒险变成一场冰冷的挑战。\n</p>\t\n\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/iceologer_1.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/iceologer_1.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"雪原中的冰术师小屋\" title=\"雪原中的冰术师小屋\">\n\t</a>\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/iceologer_2.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/iceologer_2.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"攻击村民的冰术师\" title=\"攻击村民的冰术师\">\n\t</a>\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t与冰术师相关的其他特性：\n</p>\n<ul style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Iceologer-Cabin\">冰术师小屋</a>结构</li>\n\t<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Totem-of-Freezing\">冰冻图腾</a>物品</li>\n</ul>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<h1>\n\t<img title=\"Moobloom\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/moobloom.webp\" alt=\"Moobloom\" width=\"40\">\n\t<span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>\n\t<span>哞花</span>\n</h1>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t介绍<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Moobloom\">哞花</a>，这种阳光亲吻的牛身上覆盖着美丽的花朵，主要生活在繁花森林。\n\t这些花朵覆盖的伙伴不仅是美丽的风景，还与蜜蜂和谐共生。\n\t当它们行走时，哞花会留下一路绽放的花朵，将每一步都变成穿越自然奇观的迷人旅程。\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/moobloom_1.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/moobloom_1.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"毛茛哞花\" title=\"毛茛哞花\">\n\t</a>\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/moobloom_2.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/moobloom_2.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"繁花哞花\" title=\"繁花哞花\">\n\t</a>\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t与哞花相关的其他特性：\n</p>\n<ul style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Buttercup\">毛茛</a>花</li>\n\t<li>所有木质变种的<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Beehives\">蜂箱</a></li>\n\t<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Beekeeper-Area\">养蜂人区域</a>村庄结构</li>\n\t<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/",
  "contentType": "text/markdown",
  "type": "modrinth"
}
